{"anchorId":3058,"message":"The Brunswick Plane rises out of the city with a calm, self-possessed presence, as though it has been quietly watching London reshape itself around it for generations. Standing beneath it for the first time, I get the strange feeling that this tree is not just part of the street but a witness to it.","witnessAddress":"0xe0144fa05a0d32b5b1de10ccee7211616b3e3ef0","timestamp":"2026-03-22T21:07:01.758Z","secretVerified":true}